&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3719 - Director, SEO, Global Client Solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About OpenMind&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: A Leading WPP Media Brand&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OpenMind by WPP is an integrated agency model drawing on talent from across WPP. It has been created to accelerate the European transformation for Nestlé’s media function. Core to the solution is the advanced best data and technology capabilities, fuelled by WPP’s investment in AI, to maximise the impact of Nestlé media investment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OpenMind oversees Nestle&#39;s media activity in Zone Europe. With dozens of countries, +450 team members, and regular new product launches, the account is looking for an AI Discoverability Lead to provide strong SEO and GEO leadership for Nestle categories, supporting Nestlé&amp;nbsp;Search Leads and AI Leads. Being above-market, the role offers plenty of variety, with an enjoyable balance between driving growth for brands, strategic consultancy and laying the framework for excellence, ensuring we’re delivering change at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will spearhead efforts to ensure elevated AI Discoverability across categories. You will be a regional champion of Nestle’s success framework in this space, overseeing the implementation of the theory into both strategic and activation level layers. You will ensure universal understanding of the above at every level of our teams above-market and in-market, partnering with digital specialists, media planners and category leads. You will be a conduit point between teams which impact AI Discoverability, ensuring scopes are aligned in purpose through to effective completion. Operationally, there will be a focus on partnering with categories to ensure each has a respective plan in place which is best-in-class, utilising latest available resources efficiently in a prioritised manner, focussed on the generation of measurable end results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a unique opportunity to raise the bar for AI discoverability across ZEUR, working with some of the biggest brands on the planet eager to showcase their supremacy online. As the AI Discoverability Lead in the Above Market Zone team, you’d be leading a group of AI / GEO / Search specialists holding authority across the Zone. You will be partnering with brands to ensure they have a clear strategy in place to maximize on the visibility opportunity available, which will include working with brands at varied stages of digital maturity. A key part of this role is developing your sizeable supporting team of specialists who will be practically involved at every level, crawling sites, assessing data and developing solutions to achieve enhanced AI visibility. You will help drive the education of the wider Local Market teams on the approach to ensure the same principles ring true across the region, driving excellence further still. As such, excellent operational team management is essential to ensure all stakeholders are working in unison towards the strategic vision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build operational AI discoverability excellence across ZEUR, managing varied stakeholders to ensure the successful running of a significant total client budget across above-market and in-market teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-level GEO / SEO KPI management and market governance to effectively track performance across Zone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dominate the delivery of best in-class strategies at a zone level to maximise performance across Nestle Europe. These strategies then need to be adapted and rolled out for specific business units. It is vital we’re taking advantage of the short-term opportunities for Nestle whilst laying strong foundations for future changes in search.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the ZEUR Nestle Search and AI Leads to ensure the strategic focuses align with those of the specific business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective, positive management of a few direct reports and a wider team of AI, GEO and SEO specialists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build up a constructive, positive rapport with senior client contacts and third-party enablers including content agencies and development teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A confident presenter with the ability to take what can often be quite complicated concepts, distilling them down into key actions and outcomes for relevant stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to progressing initiatives focused on driving share of voice and positive consumer experiences on-site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up to date on the latest trends in all things AI discoverability (SEO / GEO / LLM) and adapting the strategy accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Knowledge &amp;amp; Abilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impressive track record of delivering multimarket SEO strategies and charting subsequent improved business performance. We view our clients’ businesses as our own and we expect you to as well.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with businesses which are made up of multiple business units and the complexity of how those businesses overlap from a search perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge across all areas of GEO from technical to content and Digital PR. Depending on the market and the business units, the best opportunities will vary, as will the subsequent requirements from the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and supporting multilayer operations across above market, clusters, and in-market. With the focus on ensuring consistent excellence and delivery of the overall strategy at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to demystify all things SEO / GEO / LLM to ensure clients and the wider team understand what actions are required to achieve compelling results. An ability to craft and deliver powerful stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and developing a talented, multi-faceted team united in a common effort to produce best in class activity as a cohesive, positive unit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Digital more broadly, engaging with the specialism in a passionate, intellectual capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with a wide range of AI / SEO / GEO tools. Experience working with partners to drive enhancements to get the most from the tool suites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience using PowerPoint and delivering presentations to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calm under pressure and able to always think about the bigger picture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
